<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine T-bill yields fall at auction.</title>
<headline>Ukraine T-bill yields fall at auction.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields at auctions of three-month, six-month, nine-month and 12-month Ukraine discount Treasury bills all fell on Tuesday, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>Results of three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p> Auction Number	   215			207</p>
<p> Issue date		 May 6, 1997	    April 29, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	    August 6, 1997	 July 29, 1997</p>
<p> Denominations	    100 hryvnia	    100 hryvnia</p>
<p> Issue volume		6.00 million hryvnia    3.00 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Amount sold		 6.00 million hryvnia    0.84 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Proceeds		    5.66 million hryvnia    0.79 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Average yield	    23.93 pct		24.02 pct</p>
<p> Average price	    94.37 pct		94.35 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted price  94.36 pct		94.35 pct</p>
<p>Results of six-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p> Auction Number	   216			212</p>
<p> Issue date		 May 6, 1997	    May 5, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	    November 5, 1997     November 5, 1997</p>
<p> Denominations	    100 hryvnia	    100 hryvnia</p>
<p> Issue volume	     20.00 million hryvnia     9.00 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Amount sold		20.00 million hryvnia     9.00 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Proceeds		   17.52 million hryvnia     7.87 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Average yield	    28.36 pct		28.70 pct</p>
<p> Average price	    87.61 pct		87.48 pct</p>
<p> Lowe    The company said the patients will be randomly assigned to</p>
<p>placebo or active PMPA tablet at one of several different dose levels.</p>
<p>The company said that at each dose level, 10 patients will receive a single dose of oral PMPA or placebo, followed by a six-day observation period.</p>
